# DMS RLE extended count fixture: valid checksums do not guarantee decodable payload
id:                     E8501
trigger_tool:           test|runtime
phase:                  testing
error_signature:        runlength bad|Extract failed
severity:               2
category:               testing, portability
match_keywords:         undms, DMS, RLE, DLE, Extract failed, count 255, extended count, consumer fixture
title:                  undms DMS RLE 测试样本的长计数必须先放被重复字节再放双字节计数
root_cause:             构造 DMS RLE 样本时把 0x90 0xff 后三个字节写成 count_hi,count_lo,value；上游 crunch_rle() 实际顺序是 value,count_hi,count_lo。即便正确填了 packed CRC、track/header CRC，解码仍返回非零并打印 Extract failed。
affected_scope:         DMS 格式回归测试、undms 解包消费者用例和任何自行生成 DMS RLE 轨的构建测试；与 .Z 源码解压问题 E6417 不同。
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/u/undms/1.3 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing 2>&1 | grep 'OHOS consumer: stored and RLE tracks decoded; 16384 bytes verified'
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           construct-dms-rle-value-before-extended-count
rec_description:        扩展 RLE 写为 0x90,0xff,value,count_hi,count_lo；分别计算 packed-data CRC16 和 unpacked-data sum16，并用存储轨加 RLE 轨双轨真实执行的 16384 字节消费者程序验证。
rec_command:            rle = bytes([0x90, 0xff, value, count >> 8, count & 0xff])  # value 在前，大端长度在后
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-test-fixture-edit
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      inspect-upstream-crunch-rle
fallback_description:   对照上游 undms.c 的 crunch_rle 分支逐字节追踪 source 指针，再重新计算 track CRC 与输出校验和。
fallback_command:       sed -n '185,213p' undms.c
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:           manual-fixture-analysis
forbid_1_pattern:       only.*crc|only.*readelf|skip.*test
forbid_1_reason:        只比对元数据或跳过消费者运行无法发现 RLE 载荷解析顺序错误。
forbid_1_consequence:   测试可能假绿，rule12 完整消费者用例失效。
principles:             P010
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E6417]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/E8501-draft-6E52.md
last_updated:           2026-09-28
source_event:           undms/1.3 制造 DMS 双轨消费者样本时初次运行 Extract failed；交换 RLE 字节顺序后 qemu 成功解出 16384 字节。
